# Muse flags — local capture handed to your own Claude Code via muse-mcp (not shared)
.muse/

# E2E scratch — a throwaway copy of e2e/fixture/ that the specs rewrite. Lives
# inside the repo (not os.tmpdir) so node_modules resolution still walks up to
# the root, and at the same depth as e2e/fixture/ so relative imports resolve
# identically in both. The committed e2e/fixture/ is read-only at runtime.
/e2e/.tmp-fixture/
/playwright-report/
/test-results/

# Local AI-tooling state (per-machine; CLAUDE.md itself IS committed).
# Root-anchored so e.g. a future docs/DESIGN.md stays committable.
/.agents/
/.claude/
/skills-lock.json
/DESIGN.md
